R (äldre fastighetsnyckel)\nFBET (fastighetsbeteckning)\nLAGFAGARE (lagfarenägare)\nORGNR (organisationsnummer)\nKOMMUNKOD (4-siffrig kod)\nKOMMUN (kommunnamn)\nTYP (ex. fastighet, 3D-fastighet)\nUPDDAT (senaste skriptkörning)\n\nKoordinatsystem: SWEREF 99 16 30.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-01-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-15"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Real estates owned by Gävle Municipality (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kommunalägd mark (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/463","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Kommunalagdmark-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/464","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/463"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1365512"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/463"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Consists real estates owned by Gävle Municipality, AB Gavlegårdarna and Gavlefastigheter AB.\n\nAttribute:\nUUID (universally unique identifier for real estates)\nFNR (deprecated real estate key)\nFBET (real estate name)\nLAGFAGARE (real estate owner)\nORGNR (organisation number)\nKOMMUNKOD (4-number code)\nKOMMUN (Municipality name)\nTYP (ex. real estate, 3D-real estate)\nUPDDAT (latest date of running the script)\n\nCoordinate system: WGS84.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden innehåller fastigheter där Gävle kommun, AB Gavlegårdarna och Gavlefastigheter är lagfarna ägare.\n\nAttribut:\nUUID (Universell unik identitet för fastigheter)\nFNR (äldre fastighetsnyckel)\nFBET (fastighetsbeteckning)\nLAGFAGARE (lagfarenägare)\nORGNR (organisationsnummer)\nKOMMUNKOD (4-siffrig kod)\nKOMMUN (kommunnamn)\nTYP (ex. fastighet, 3D-fastighet)\nUPDDAT (senaste skriptkörning)\n\nKoordinatesystem: WGS84.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-01-08"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-15"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Real estates owned by Gävle Municipality (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kommunalägd mark (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:182aba05fa3a253aea02f39d2668492c002b2c0bc2aa90254e615b2e328cc031"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:1870e88b24baab080f08063da928cc9355184054f78f04359c6f53b7e5e349f1_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"_:1870e88b24baab080f08063da928cc9355184054f78f04359c6f53b7e5e349f1_b1n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radonmätningarna registreras i kommunens verksamhetssystem EDP Vision. GIS-enheten läser ut och filtrerar informationen för att anpassas till lämpligt format för Öppna data."}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/100","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/99"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1161057"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/99"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The shapefile contains values for measured radoncontent in the indoor air.\n\nAttribute data contains: Identity, Type, Property, Measurement Location, Measurement Location, Apartment Number, Other Apartment Number, Mean Value, Unit, Building Time, Start Date, Stop Date, Radon Gas, Floor Plan, Measurement Period, Measurement Time, Measurement Method, Building Type, Building Material, Ground, Ventilation Type, Coordinate value, North, East.\nCoordinate system: SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Shapefilen innehåller värden för uppmätt radonhalt i inomhusluften.\n\nAttributdata innehåller: Identitet, Typ, Fastighet, Mätplatsadress, Mätplatsort, Lägenhetsnummer, Annat lägenhetsnummer, Medelvärde, Enhet, Byggnadsid, Startdatum, Stoppdatum, Radongas, Våningsplan, Mätperiod, Mättid, Mätmetod, Hustyp, Byggnadsmaterial, Grund, Ventilationstyp,Byggnadsår, Ombyggnadsår, Koordinatvärde, North, East. \nKoordinatsystem: SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2018-10-30"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-18"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radon (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radon (*shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/101","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Radon-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/102","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/101"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1050686"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/101"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The shapefile contains values for measured radoncontent in the indoor air.\n\nAttribute data contains: Identity, Type, Property, Measurement Location, Measurement Location, Apartment Number, Other Apartment Number, Mean Value, Unit, Building Time, Start Date, Stop Date, Radon Gas, Floor Plan, Measurement Period, Measurement Time, Measurement Method, Building Type, Building Material, Ground, Ventilation Type, Coordinate value, North, East.\nCoordinate system: WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Shapefilen innehåller värden för uppmätt radonhalt i inomhusluften.\n\nAttributdata innehåller: Identitet, Typ, Fastighet, Mätplatsadress, Mätplatsort, Lägenhetsnummer, Annat lägenhetsnummer, Medelvärde, Enhet, Byggnadsid, Startdatum, Stoppdatum, Radongas, Våningsplan, Mätperiod, Mättid, Mätmetod, Hustyp, Byggnadsmaterial, Grund, Ventilationstyp,Byggnadsår, Ombyggnadsår, Koordinatvärde, North, East. \nKoordinatsystem: WGS84."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2018-10-30"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-18"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radon (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radon (*json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:1870e88b24baab080f08063da928cc9355184054f78f04359c6f53b7e5e349f1_b0n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/98","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/100"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/102"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Identity"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Year of construction"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnadsår"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Enhet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Hustyp"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Identitet"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Medelvärde"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mätplatsadress"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Ventilationstyp"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/MONTHLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Measured radoncontent in indoor air.\n\nThe data shows the values for the radon measurements received from Gävle municipality. There may be more measurements made that the municipality has no knowledge of. In multi-family houses, measurements may have been made in several different apartments with different results but the location of the measurement is linked to the entrance address or property where the measurement was performed.\n\nFrom 2000, the information in the radon measurements is more often complete. From 2001, measuring points and floor plans are separated in each column, which may facilitate executions.\n\nThe update of the information is ongoing. Partly ongoing for single incoming radon measurements and partly in connection with annual combined deliveries from radon laboratories.\nThe Environmental and Healthprotection department at the Community building Gävle is responsible for the information.\n\nThe dataset is also included in the Gävle Municipality's web map Radonkartan.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uppmätt radonhalt i inomhusluften.\n\nDatamängden redovisar värden för de radonmätningar som inkommit till Gävle kommun. Det kan finnas fler mätningar gjorda som kommunen inte har kännedom om. I flerbostadshus kan mätningar ha gjorts i flera olika lägenheter med olika resultat men mätningens läge är kopplat till entréadress eller fastighet där mätningen utförts.\n\nFrån år 2000 är informationen i radonmätningarna oftare komplett. Från år 2001 är mätpunkt och våningsplan separerade i varsin kolumn vilket kan underlätta utsökningar.\n\nUppdateringen av informationen sker kontinuerligt. Dels löpande för enstaka inkommande radonmätningar och dels i samband med årliga sammanställda leveranser från radonlaboratorier.\nMiljö- och hälsoskyddsavdelningen på Samhällsbyggnad Gävle ansvarar för informationen.\n\nDatamängden ingår även i Gävle kommuns webbkarta Radonkartan.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information. "}],"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:1870e88b24baab080f08063da928cc9355184054f78f04359c6f53b7e5e349f1_b1n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Radon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Radon"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/99","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Radonmatningar.zip"}],"@id":"urn:source:1870e88b24baab080f08063da928cc9355184054f78f04359c6f53b7e5e349f1"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:1a6ae0f1b81a25b29421afea411f874c041448912f9409fa0a20d78f60947e5b_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/357","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/359"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/361"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Exercise"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdoor gym"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Motion"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utegym"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdoor gyms in Gävle Municipality. \n \nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utegym inom Gävle kommun.\n \nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdoor gyms"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utegym"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/358","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Utegym.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/359","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/358"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1238"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/358"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing outdoor gyms in Gävle Municipality. Attrbute data: \n\nNAMN (Outdoor gym name) \n\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller utegym i Gävle kommun. Attributdata: \n\nNAMN (Utegymnamn) \n\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-02-20"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-09"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdoor gyms (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utegym (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/360","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Utegym-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/361","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/360"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"369"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/360"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing outdoor gyms in Gävle Municipality. Attribute data:\n\nNAMN (Outdoor gym name). \n\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller utegym inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata: \n\nNAMN (Utegymnamn)\n\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-02-20"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-09"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Outdoor gyms (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Utegym (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:1a6ae0f1b81a25b29421afea411f874c041448912f9409fa0a20d78f60947e5b_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:1a6ae0f1b81a25b29421afea411f874c041448912f9409fa0a20d78f60947e5b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b0n0","@type":"http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#RightsStatement","http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#copyrightHolder":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"}},{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b1n0","@type":"http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#RightsStatement","http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#copyrightHolder":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"}},{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b2n0","@type":"http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#RightsStatement","http://schema.theodi.org/odrs#copyrightHolder":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"}},{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b3n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/275","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/276"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/278"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/280"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Aeroplane"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Air"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Aircraft"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Image"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Oblique"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Photo"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Photograph"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Plane"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbild"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygfoto"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygplan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Plan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Snedbild"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial photos in Gävle Municipality in the form of oblique images.\nAll images has undergone safety review performed by the Swedish National Land Survey.\nPhotography: Bergslagsbild AB\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilder i Gävle kommun i form av snedbilder.\nAlla bilder är säkerhetsgranskade av Lantmäteriet. \nFoto: Bergslagsbild AB\n \nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial Photos"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilder"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/276","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://gis.gavle.se/portal/apps/experiencebuilder/experience/?id=02b80e20ebe84be5a4d1218fe118fc2d"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial photos in the form of oblique images are available for download in this webmap.\nAll images has undergone safety review performed by the Swedish National Land Survey.\nPhotography: Bergslagsbild AB"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilderna (snedbilder) finns tillgängliga för att titta på och kan laddas ned via webbkartan i länken. \nAlla bilder är säkerhetsgranskade av Lantmäteriet. \nFoto: Bergslagsbild AB"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial Photos"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilder"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/277","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Flygbilder.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/278","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/277"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"64484"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/277"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two shapefiles containing aerial photos as point features. One shapefile contains the object that was photographed and the other contains the position of the actual photos.\n\nAttributes of FOTO_OBJEKT are ID, ANTBILD (number of photos), DATUM (date), BESKRIVN (description), OMRADE (area).\n\nAttributes of FOTO_SNEDBILDER are ID, BILDNAMN (name of image), DATUM (date), FLYGHOJD (altitude) , TID (time), BESKRIVN (description), RIKTNING (geographic direction of photo), SOKVAG (link to image).\n\nCardinality is 1:M between FOTO_OBJEKT and FOTO_SNEDBILDER where the key is ID.\n\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Två shapefiler som innehåller flygbilder i form av punkter. En fil med fotograferat objekt och en med tillhörande fotografier.\n\nAttributdata i FOTO_OBJEKT består av ID, ANTBILD (antal bilder), DATUM, BESKRIVN, OMRADE.\n\nAttributdata i FOTO_SNEDBILDER består av ID, BILDNAMN, DATUM, FLYGHOJD, TID, BESKRIVN, RIKTNING (vilken geografisk riktning fotograferingen gjordes i), SOKVAG (innehåller länk för nedladdning av bilden).\n\nKardinaliteten är 1:M mellan FOTO_OBJEKT och FOTO_SNEDBILDER där nyckeln är ID.\n\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-11-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-03"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial Photos (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilder (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/279","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Flygbilder-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/280","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/279"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"39729"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/279"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two GeoJSON files containing aerial photos as point features. One shapefile contains the object that was photographed and the other contains the position of the actual photos.\n\nAttributes of FOTO_OBJEKT are ID, ANTBILD (number of photos), DATUM (date), BESKRIVN (description), OMRADE (area).\n\nAttributes of FOTO_SNEDBILDER are ID, BILDNAMN (name of image), DATUM (date), FLYGHOJD (altitude), TID (time), BESKRIVN (description), RIKTNING (geographic direction of photo), SOKVAG (link to image).\n\nCardinality is 1:M between FOTO_OBJEKT and FOTO_SNEDBILDER where the key is ID.\n\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Två GeoJSON filer som innehåller flygbilder i form av punkter. En fil med fotograferat objekt och en med tillhörande fotografier.\n\nAttributdata i FOTO_OBJEKT består av ID, ANTBILD (antal bilder), DATUM, BESKRIVN, OMRADE.\n\nAttributdata i FOTO_SNEDBILDER består av ID, BILDNAMN, DATUM, FLYGHOJD, TID, BESKRIVN, RIKTNING (vilken geografisk riktning fotograferingen gjordes i), SOKVAG (innehåller länk för nedladdning av bilden).\n\nKardinaliteten är 1:M mellan FOTO_OBJEKT och FOTO_SNEDBILDER där nyckeln är ID.\n\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-11-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-03"},"dct:rights":{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b2n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Aerial Photos (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Flygbilder (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3_b3n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:20a9fe439528d7a1f655893b674838219e908ff6545ac89f21aba70470961ce3"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:24ae360c666def2d996242ddc015fc1e63e0b8f20cda282567001c85e4885621_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/306","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/311"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Charging station"},{"@language":"en","@value":"EV charger"},{"@language":"en","@value":"EV"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Electric vehicle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elfordon"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Laddare"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Laddstation"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://www.energimyndigheten.se/klimat--miljo/transporter/energieffektiva-och-fossilfria-fordon-och-transporter/laddinfrastruktur/registrera-din-laddstation/"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UNKNOWN"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public charging stations owned by Gävle Energi are linked on the website https://www.energimyndigheten.se/klimat--miljo/transporter/energieffektiva-och-fossilfria-fordon-och-transporter/laddinfrastruktur/registrera-din-laddstation/.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Offentliga laddstationer som ägs av Gävle Energi finns länkade på webbplatsen https://www.energimyndigheten.se/klimat--miljo/transporter/energieffektiva-och-fossilfria-fordon-och-transporter/laddinfrastruktur/registrera-din-laddstation/.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Charging stations"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Laddstationer"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/311","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www.energimyndigheten.se/klimat--miljo/transporter/energieffektiva-och-fossilfria-fordon-och-transporter/laddinfrastruktur/registrera-din-laddstation/"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The public charging stations owned by Gävle Energi can be downloaded by calling an API that is linked on the Swedish Energy Agency's website."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"De offentliga laddstationerna som ägs av Gävle Energi finns att ladda ned genom att anropa det API som finns länkat från Energimyndighetens webbplats."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Swedish Energy Agency"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Energimyndigheten"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:24ae360c666def2d996242ddc015fc1e63e0b8f20cda282567001c85e4885621_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:24ae360c666def2d996242ddc015fc1e63e0b8f20cda282567001c85e4885621"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:305ea813b76ca627b17063b7e70e7571072eac0f4c11805c9f3f9afe3f6dea60_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/199","@type":"dcat:Data