tiveInteger","@value":"1520"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/83"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing playgrounds in Gävle. Attribute data:\nNAMN (Name of the playground)\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller lekplatser i Gävle. Attributdata:\nNAMN (Namnet på lekplatsen)\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-30"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Playgrounds (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Lekplatser (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:6fbabd6aab1d873c25912ea1e26c217ef94534378f61de20fc859b774c669785"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:70a78744e97dd1c722f134ac65558e3ce5f768332d05e65c670a58a4041d0d5c_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/445","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/447"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/449"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"historical drawings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"historical maps"},{"@language":"en","@value":"historical photo"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"historiska foto"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"historiska kartor"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"historiska ritningar"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The data set contains a selection of historical building drawings, photographs and maps from Gävle municipal archives' documents.\n\nThe purpose of the data set is to give the user a new opportunity to view and integrate with the archive documents and get more information about Gävle municipality's history and urban development.\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden innehåller ett urval av historiska byggnadsritningar, fotografier och kartor från Gävle kommunarkivs handlingar. \n\nSyftet med datamängden är att ge användaren en ny möjlighet att se och integrera med arkivhandlingarna och få mer information om Gävle kommuns historia och stadsutveckling. \n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-04"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-12-04"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gävle Municipal Archive - GEO-data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommunarkivs - GEO-Data"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/446","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"application/x-zip-compressed","dct:title":"gavle_kommunarkivs_geo-data.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/447","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/446"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"149917"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/446"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/x-zip-compressed","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gävle Municipal Archive - GEO-data (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommunarkivs - GEO-Data (*.shp)"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/448","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"application/x-zip-compressed","dct:title":"gavle_kommunarkivs_geo-data-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/449","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/448"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"123218"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/448"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/x-zip-compressed","dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gävle Municipal Archive - GEO-data (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommunarkivs - GEO-Data (*.json)"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:70a78744e97dd1c722f134ac65558e3ce5f768332d05e65c670a58a4041d0d5c_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:70a78744e97dd1c722f134ac65558e3ce5f768332d05e65c670a58a4041d0d5c"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:7755d44a12bbee9ef9a446e0ec6df2329537484aacb61b9e037cb9d18e01ed08_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/152","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/165"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Internet"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Network"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Wi-Fi"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Wireless"},{"@language":"en","@value":"_gavle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Nätverk"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Trådlöst"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TECH"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UPDATE_CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"This data set has been deprecated and is not recommended for any use.\n\nLocation of access points for public wireless network in the city center and outlying areas of Gävle Municipality. SSID/Network name \"_Gavle WiFi\".\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Denna datamängd uppdateras inte längre. Det rekommenderas att du avstår från att använda den.\n\nPlacering av accesspunkter för publikt trådlöst nätverk i Gävle kommuns stadskärna och ytterområden. SSID/Nätverksnamn ”_Gavle WiFi”.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public Wi-Fi"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Publikt Wi-Fi"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/164","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"text/csv","dct:title":"Public_WiFi.csv"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/165","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/164"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2000"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/164"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Location of access points in the city center and outlying areas of Gävle Municipality. Attribute data contains coordinates (SWEREF99 TM) and property designation."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Placering av accesspunkter i Gävle kommuns stadskärna samt ytterområden. Attributdata innehåller koordinater (SWEREF99 TM) och fastighetsbeteckning."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-04-02"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-01-10T12:02:52.131Z"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Public Wi-Fi (*.csv)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Publikt Wi-Fi (*.csv)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:7755d44a12bbee9ef9a446e0ec6df2329537484aacb61b9e037cb9d18e01ed08_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:7755d44a12bbee9ef9a446e0ec6df2329537484aacb61b9e037cb9d18e01ed08"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:7c7f8588f95f30d3bcead927cba9a8f1d3cf8382d337ce136a719116ba033695_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/433","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/435"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/437"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"bicycle"},{"@language":"en","@value":"bike"},{"@language":"en","@value":"measurement"},{"@language":"en","@value":"traffic"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"cykel"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"cykelmätning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"trafik"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"trafikmätning"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Data gathered from points measuring bicycle traffic.Please be aware of the fact that the measure points might not be functional at all times.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Redovisar data från mätpunkter för cykeltrafik. Observera att mätpunkterna inte alltid fungerar.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-10-26"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-10-26"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bicycle traffic measurements"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cykelmätningar"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/434","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"cykelmatningar.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/435","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/434"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"1748"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/434"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing bicycle traffic measurements in Gävle Municipality.\n\nAttribute data:\n\nID (Site ID)\nNAME (Site name)\nADDRESS (Site address)\nDATEUPD (Date of API-call)\nTIMEUPD (Time of API-call in the format of HHMMSS)\nLAT\nLONG\nPC_ID (Passage controller ID)\nPC_NAME (Passage controller name)\nPC_COUNT_T (Passage controller count today)\nPC_COUNT_Y (Passage controller count year)\n\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller cykelmätningar inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata:\n\nID (Site ID)\nNAME (Site name)\nADDRESS (Site address)\nDATEUPD (Datum som API-anropet gjordes)\nTIMEUPD (Klockslag enligt HHMMSS som API-anropet gjordes)\nLAT\nLONG\nPC_ID (Passage controller ID)\nPC_NAME (Passage controller name)\nPC_COUNT_T (Passage controller count today)\nPC_COUNT_Y (Passage controller count year)\n\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-10-25"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bicycle traffic measurements (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cykelmätningar (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/436","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:format":"application/x-zip-compressed","dct:title":"cykelmatningar.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/437","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/436"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"693"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/436"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing bicycle measurements in Gävle Municipality.\n\nAttribute data:\n\nID (Site ID)\nNAME (Site name)\nADDRESS (Site address)\nDATEUPDATED (Date of API-call)\nTIMEUPDATED  (Time of API-call in the format HHMMSS)\nLAT\nLONG\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_ID (Passage controller ID)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_NAME (Passage controller name)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_COUNT_TODAY (Passage controller count today)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_COUNT_YEAR (Passage controller count year)\n\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller cykelmätningar inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata:\n\nID (Site ID)\nNAME (Site name)\nADDRESS (Site address)\nDATEUPDATED (Datum som API-anropet gjordes)\nTIMEUPDATED (Klockslag enligt HHMMSS som API-anropet gjordes)\nLAT\nLONG\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_ID (Passage controller ID)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_NAME (Passage controller name)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_COUNT_TODAY (Passage controller count today)\nPASSAGECONTROLLER_COUNT_YEAR (Passage controller count year)\n\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84.."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-10-25"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-16"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bicycle traffic measurements (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Cykelmätningar (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:7c7f8588f95f30d3bcead927cba9a8f1d3cf838