"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:8e180b8b13dadfd69c2debfe7ec0766b44e37d7752749bb1b82231e4151f3fbe_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:8e180b8b13dadfd69c2debfe7ec0766b44e37d7752749bb1b82231e4151f3fbe"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:916602bb501a517153f3cd1a281fef9ca15095257f4263d07415a6ead162db07_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/385","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/387"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/389"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Bush"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Equipment"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Grass"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Hedge"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Nature"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Paved surface"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trees"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Water system"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Buskar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gräs"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Häckar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Markbeläggning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Markutrustning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Natur"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Träd"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vattenanläggning"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL_2"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Objects in Gävle Municipality where the municipal company Gavlefastigheter is responsible for the maintenance (e.g. grass surfaces and paved surfaces).\n\nThis data is used as base when calculating costs for maintenance and  care, as well as in procurement. \n\nThe schema is the same as for the dataset Maintenance objects - Gavlegårdarna, therefore these two datasets can be consumed together.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Objekt i Gävle kommun där det kommunala fastighetsbolaget Gavlefastigheter ansvarar för skötsel.  Datat innehåller vad för slags skötselytor Gästrike Fastigheter har (ex. gräsytor och markbeläggningsytor).\n\nSchemat för innehållet ser likadant ut som för datamängden Skötselobjekt - Gavlegårdarna, så de kan med fördel konsumeras tillsammans.\n\nSkötseldatat används som underlag vid framtagning av skötsel- och underhållskostnader samt vid upphandlingar.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Maintenance objects - Gavlefastigheter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skötselobjekt - Gavlefastigheter"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/386","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Skotsel_gfab.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/387","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/386"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4734908"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/386"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Eleven shapefiles containing different types of maintenance objects:\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_LINJE: Bushes and hedges (lines)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_YTA: Bushes and hedges (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_GRAS_YTA: Grass (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKBELAGGNINGAR_YTA: Paved surface (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_LINJE: Equipment (lines)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_PUNKT: Equipment (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_NATUR_YTA: Nature (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_RABATTER_YTA: Flower beds (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_TRAD_PUNKT: Trees (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_PUNKT: Water systems (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_YTA: Water systems (polygons)\n\nAttribute in all shapefiles:\nSKOTS_PROD - Maintenance product. Specifies type.\n\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elva shapefiler som innehåller olika typer av skötselobjekt:\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_LINJE: Buskar och häckar (linje)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_YTA: Buskar och häckar (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_GRAS_YTA: Gräs (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKBELAGGNINGAR_YTA: Markbeläggningar (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_LINJE: Markutrustning (linje)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_PUNKT: Markutrustning (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_NATUR_YTA: Natur (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_RABATTER_YTA: Rabatter (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_TRAD_PUNKT: Träd (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_PUNKT: Vattenanläggningar (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_YTA: Vattenanläggningar (yta)\n\nAttribut i samtliga shapefiler:\nSKOTS_PROD - Skötselprodukt. Anger typ.\n\nFilernas koordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-05-31"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-04"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Maintenance objects Gästrike Fastigheter (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skötselobjekt Gästrike Fastigheter (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/388","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"Skotsel_gfab-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/389","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/388"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4225265"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/388"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Eleven GeoJSON files containing different types of maintenance objects:\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_LINJE: Bushes and hedges (lines)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_YTA: Bushes and hedges (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_GRAS_YTA: Grass (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKBELAGGNINGAR_YTA: Paved surfaces (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_LINJE: Equipment (lines)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_PUNKT: Equipment (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_NATUR_YTA: Nature (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_RABATTER_YTA: Flower beds (polygons)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_TRAD_PUNKT: Trees (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_PUNKT: Water systems (points)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_YTA: Water systems (polygons)\n\nAttribute in all GeoJSON files:\nSKOTS_PROD - Maintenance product. Specifies type.\n\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Elva GeoJSON filer som innehåller olika typer av skötselobjekt:\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_LINJE: Buskar och häckar (linje)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_BUSKAR_HACKAR_YTA: Buskar och häckar (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_GRAS_YTA: Gräs (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKBELAGGNINGAR_YTA: Markbeläggningar (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_LINJE: Markutrustning (linje)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_MARKUTRUSTNING_PUNKT: Markutrustning (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_NATUR_YTA: Natur (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_RABATTER_YTA: Rabatter (yta)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_TRAD_PUNKT: Träd (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_PUNKT: Vattenanläggningar (punkt)\nGFAB_SKOTSELOBJEKT_VATTENANLAGGNINGAR_YTA: Vattenanläggningar (yta)\n\nAttribut i samtliga GeoJSON filer:\nSKOTS_PROD - Skötselprodukt. Anger typ.\n\nFilernas koordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-05-31"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-06-04"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Maintenance objects Gästrike Fastigheter (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skötselobjekt Gästrike Fastigheter (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:916602bb501a517153f3cd1a281fef9ca15095257f4263d07415a6ead162db07_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:916602bb501a517153f3cd1a281fef9ca15095257f4263d07415a6ead162db07"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:989cc75062d71daa190bbd34caf1445be8317757bcf26cf8a2836c41d2ab6654_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/489","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/491"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"account description"},{"@language":"en","@value":"account"},{"@language":"en","@value":"accounting"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"balansräkning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"bokföring"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kodplan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kommun-Bas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"konto"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kontobeskrivning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"kontoplan"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"resultaträkning"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ECON"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/QUARTERLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The chart of accounts is a list of all the accounts the Municipality of Gävle uses in its accounting. It is the basis for the municipality's accounting, financial statements and declaration.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kontoplanen är en förteckning över alla de konton Gävle kommun använder i sin bokföring. Den ligger till grund för kommunens redovisning, bokslut och deklaration. \n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-14"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2712409"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chart of accounts"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kontoplan"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/490","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"kontoplan[1].xlsx"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/491","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/490"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"24"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/490"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Skriv mer. \n\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skriv mer. \n\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. \n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information"}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/XLSX"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-02"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-12-02"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Chart of account (*.xlsx)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kontoplan (*.xlsx)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:989cc75062d71daa190bbd34caf1445be8317757bcf26cf8a2836c41d2ab6654_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:989cc75062d71daa190bbd34caf1445be8317757bcf26cf8a2836c41d2ab6654"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9e62cf86db287798e93f2dd69cca1dc1fb6c5820a29008d14da9b0c29a09abc1_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/194","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/196"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/198"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Characteristic areas"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural buildings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural environments"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural parks"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Cultural passages"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Karaktärsområden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturhistorisk bebyggelse"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturhistoriska parker"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturhistoriska stråk  "},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kulturmiljöer"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Valued cultural environments within Gävle Municipality.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Värdefulla kulturmiljöer enligt plan- och bygglagens 8 kap. 13 § inom Gävle kommun. Områdena ingår i översiktsplaner och kulturmiljöprogram vilka är beslutade av Kommunfullmäktige.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Valued cultural environments"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Värdefulla kulturmiljöer"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/195","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"vardefulla_kulturmiljoer.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/196","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/195"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"214438"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/195"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing valued cultural environments in Gävle Municipality. Attribute data: objekttyp=object type , omrade=area, anm=description, kommundel=part of municipality, namn=name, områdestyp=type of area and lagakraftdatum=legally binding date.\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller värdefulla kulturmiljöer inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata består av objekttyp (Kulturhistorisk bebyggelse, Karaktärsområden, Kulturhistoriska stråk, parker), område, anmärkning, sökväg, kommundel, namn, områdestyp och lagakraftdatum.\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-04-30"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-01"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Valued cultural environments (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Värdefulla kulturmiljöer (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/197","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"vardefulla_kulturmiljoer-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/198","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/197"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"83623"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/197"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing valued cultural environments in Gävle Municipality. Attribute data: objekttyp=object type , omrade=area, anm=description, kommundel=part om municipality, namn=name, områdestyp=type of area and lagakraftdatum=legally binding date.\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller värdefulla kulturmiljöer inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata består av objekttyp (Kulturhistorisk bebyggelse, Karaktärsområden, Kulturhistoriska stråk, parker), område, anmärkning, sökväg, kommundel, namn, områdestyp och lagakraftdatum.\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-04-30"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-01"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Valued cultural environments (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Värdefulla kulturmiljöer (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:9e62cf86db287798e93f2dd69cca1dc1fb6c5820a29008d14da9b0c29a09abc1_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9e62cf86db287798e93f2dd69cca1dc1fb6c5820a29008d14da9b0c29a09abc1"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:9f3b0a7b0de3e1b303bd7c4f37b42b1e6bb63967c02ea019e5b07728f6ed3b8f_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Innehållet i baskartans datamängder kommer ursprungligen från olika källor. Exempelvis Lantmäteriets fastighetskarta, fotogrammetisk digitalisering, traditionell inmätning med GNSS eller totalstation. Noggrannhet och aktualitet kan variera kraftigt beroende på insamlingsmetod och insamlingstillfälle. Det bör tas i beaktande vid användning av data."}},{"@id":"_:9f3b0a7b0de3e1b303bd7c4f37b42b1e6bb63967c02ea019e5b07728f6ed3b8f_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/20","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/44"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/497"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/77"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Building polygon"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Building type"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Business"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Canopy"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Complementary building"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Industry"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Outbuilding"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Water tower"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Wind power station"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnadsbeteckning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnadsyta"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Industri"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Komplementbyggnad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Skärmtak"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uthus"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vattentorn"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Verksamheter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vindkraftverk"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/IRREG"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Building polygons and building types from Gävles basemap. The geometries are represented in 2D.\n\nBuilding types are represented as line objects illustrating if a building polygon represent the roof or the facade.\n\nThe basemap provided by us is constructed in an accurate, timeless way, it is tailored from set specifics. We strive to have correct information, but we cannot guarantee it in all regard. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnadspolygoner och byggnadsbeteckningar från Gävles baskarta. Geometrierna är representerade i 2D.\n\nByggnadsbeteckningar är linjeobjekt som illustrerar om en byggnadspolygon representerar takutsprång eller fasad.\n\nGävle kommun upplyser om att baskartans innehåll med avseende på noggrannhet och aktualitet överensstämmer med fastställda specifikationer och beskrivningar. Gävle kommun strävar efter att informationen skall vara så riktig som möjligt men kan inte garantera det i alla avseenden.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till kunden. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för kunden till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:9f3b0a7b0de3e1b303bd7c4f37b42b1e6bb63967c02ea019e5b07728f6ed3b8f_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap - Buildings"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta - Byggnader"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kartdeklaration Gävle kommuns baskarta"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/43","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-byggnader.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/44","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/43"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"13402765"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/43"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two shapefiles containing building polygons and building types from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of building type, date of last update, file date and collection method. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Två shapefiler som innehåller byggnadsytor och byggnadsbeteckningar från Gävles baskarta. Attributdata innehåller byggnadstyp, uppdateringsdatum, fildatum och insamlingsmetod. Koordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-13"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Buildings (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnader (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/496","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-byggnader-gpkg.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/497","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/496"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"15611809"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/496"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"One geopackage containing building polygons and building types from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of building type, date of last update, file date and collection method. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En geopackage som innehåller byggnadsytor och byggnadsbeteckningar från Gävles baskarta. Attributdata innehåller byggnadstyp, uppdateringsdatum, fildatum och insamlingsmetod. Koordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-13"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Buildings (*.gpkg)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnader (*.gpkg)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:9f3b0a7b0de3e1b303bd7c4f37b42b1e6bb63967c02ea019e5b07728f6ed3b8f_b1n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/76","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-byggnader-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/77","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/76"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"3621475"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/76"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Two geojson files containing building polygons and building types from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of building type, date of last update, file date and collection method. The spatial reference is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Två geojson-filer som innehåller byggnadsytor och byggnadsbeteckningar från Gävles baskarta. Attributdata innehåller byggnadstyp, uppdateringsdatum, fildatum och insamlingsmetod. Koordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-13"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Buildings (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnader (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:9f3b0a7b0de3e1b303bd7c4f37b42b1e6bb63967c02ea019e5b07728f6ed3b8f"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Road damage inventory ordered by the municipality of Gävle and carried out during the summer of 2015. The service Mapillary has been used to publish and process the images to blur out people's faces and vehicle registration plates."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägskadeinventering beställd av Gävle kommun och utförd sommaren 2015. Tjänsten Mapillary har använts för att publicera och bearbeta bilder automatiskt för att sudda ut ansikten och bilars registreringsnummer."}]},{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:endDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-08-25"},"dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2015-06-25"}},{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b2n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/143","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/144"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"360 degrees"},{"@language":"en","@value":"360 images"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Mapillary"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Panorama"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Street View"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Street images"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"360 grader"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"360-bilder"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gatubilder"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gatuvy"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/UNKNOWN"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"360° panoramic images covering large parts of Gävle's road network, both bicycle lanes and roads are included. A total of approximately 48 000 images are available. The material was produced when the municipality of Gävle carried out a road damage inventory from June to August in 2015. The service Mapillary has been used to publish and make the images available as open data.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Panoramabilder med 360° vy över stora delar av Gävles vägnät, både bilvägar och cykelvägar ingår. Totalt ca 48 000 bilder finns tillgängliga. Materialet togs fram i samband med en vägskadeinventering som utfördes på uppdrag av Gävle kommun från juni till augusti 2015. Tjänsten Mapillary används för att tillgängliggöra bilderna som öppna data.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b1n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"360° Panoramic Images"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"360° Panoramabilder "}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/144","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://www.mapillary.com/app/?lat=60.67706109785604&lng=17.150143291964582&z=10.94100335572431&focus=map&username%5B%5D=gavlekommun&username%5B%5D=gavlekommun_gc&panos=true"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The images can be viewed and downloaded from the service Mapillary. People's faces and vehicle registration plates have been blurred out."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gatubilderna finns tillgängliga för att titta på och kan laddas ned i tjänsten Mapillary. Ansikten och bilars registrernummer har suddats ut."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/HTML"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Mapillary"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Mapillary"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5_b2n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:a03568ec6e588ede9900fc6290b8670ca0f891af61161e90ccd13db23ecc08a5"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:b14c8af85ba4357972321a6cf936e8f1864684fd15e4aa208130901f7f0a2038_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/270","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/272"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/274"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Garbage can"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Trash can"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Waste container"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Papperskorg"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/WEEKLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Waste containers in Gävle. Points, types and waste collection frequency.\n \nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Papperskorgar i Gävle. Punkter och typer.\n \nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Waste containers"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Papperskorgar"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/271","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"papperskorgar.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/272","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/271"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"29840"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/271"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing waste containers in Gävle. Attribute data:\nPRODTYP (Product type)\nMATMETOD (Method of measurement)\nUPDDATUM (Date of update)\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller papperskorgar i Gävle. Attributdata:\nPRODTYP (Produkttyp)\nMATMETOD (Mätmetod)\nUPDDATUM (Uppdateringsdatum)\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2019-10-28"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-15"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Waste containers (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Papperskorgar (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dis