vle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans under development"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner under arbete"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/382","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://gis.gavle.se/pubs/dpunderarbete/wms?request=GetCapabilities&service=WMS"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/serviceType/ogc/wms"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans under development in Gävle Municipality as a Web Map Service (WMS). The service supports the coordinate system SWEREF 99 16 30. Read the service capabilites for more information.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle cannot guarantee that the service is available at all times. Recurrent system maintenance and other operations may result in service downtime."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner under arbete i Gävle kommun som WMS. Tjänsten stödjer koordinatsystemet SWEREF 99 16 30. Använd anropet GetCapabilites för att se mer information om tjänsten.\n\nGävle kommun kan inte garantera att tjänsten är tillgänglig vid alla tidpunkter. Återkommande systemunderhåll och andra driftåtgärder kan innebära att tjänsten ibland inte går att nå."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-05-25"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans under development (WMS)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner under arbete (WMS)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:b54931ef1b619ffb58afa0fdbb75707196b049172fbcd1e0f57760a13e3b377d_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:b54931ef1b619ffb58afa0fdbb75707196b049172fbcd1e0f57760a13e3b377d"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:b7ba91eb37d6c7321d4d3e00384f5a36328607fcb21bc064233928b7045c5819_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Uppdateringar hämtas dagligen från fastighetsregistret hos Lantmäteriet till Gävles lokala databas."}},{"@id":"_:b7ba91eb37d6c7321d4d3e00384f5a36328607fcb21bc064233928b7045c5819_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kartdeklaration Gävle kommuns baskarta"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/45","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/49"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/495"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/89"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Address"},{"@language":"en","@value":"City"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Postal code"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Real estate property"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Status"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Street address"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adress"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fastighetsbeteckning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gatuadress"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Postnummer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Postort"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Status"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/DAILY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Addresses from Gävles basemap. \n\nThe basemap provided by us is constructed in an accurate, timeless way, it is tailored from set specifics. We strive to have correct information, but we cannot guarantee it in all regard. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adresspunkter från Gävles baskarta. \n\nGävle kommun upplyser om att baskartans innehåll med avseende på noggrannhet och aktualitet överensstämmer med fastställda specifikationer och beskrivningar. Gävle kommun strävar efter att informationen skall vara så riktig som möjligt men kan inte garantera det i alla avseenden.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till kunden. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för kunden till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:b7ba91eb37d6c7321d4d3e00384f5a36328607fcb21bc064233928b7045c5819_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2712409"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap - Addresses"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta - Adresser"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/48","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-adresser.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/49","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/48"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2358184"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/48"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefil containing addresses from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of address status, street address, postal, city, municipal part, municipality, popular name, municipal code, intersecting property unit, date of last update, file date and WGS 84 coordinates. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller adresser från Gävles baskarta. Attributdata innehåller adresstatus, gatuadress, postnr, postort. kommundel, kommun, populärnamn, kommunkod, fastighetsbeteckning, uppdateringsdatum, fildatum och koordinater i WGS84. Filens koordinatsystem är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-13"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Adresses (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adresser (*.shp)"}],