 kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Accessibility"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgänglighet"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/335","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"tillganglighet.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/336","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/335"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"56569"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/335"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The result of accessibility inspections in Gävle consist of several shapefiles. These files och their attributes are described in attached documentation.\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgängglighetsinventeringen i Gävle består av ett antal shapefiler. Dessa filer och deras attribut finns beskrivna i bifogad dokumentation.\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-02-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-18"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Accessibility (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgänglighet (*.shp)"}],"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/339"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/340"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/337","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"tillganglighet-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/338","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/337"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"24929"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/337"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The result of accessibility inspections in Gävle consist of several GeoJSON files. These files och their attributes are described in attached documentation.\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgängglighetsinventeringen i Gävle består av ett antal GeoJSON filer. Dessa filer och deras attribut finns beskrivna i bifogad dokumentation.\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-02-12"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-18"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Accessibility (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Tillgänglighet (*.json)"}],"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/339"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/340"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:c4fc8d76b8a0b50e48008802ec103ba754d2654578ef39d995dca9aa1af9886b_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:c4fc8d76b8a0b50e48008802ec103ba754d2654578ef39d995dca9aa1af9886b"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:c5c11a8a49edc47566f372563cca8b4ce6652ccd7f8d752ff5c8549a1102678f_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/506","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/508"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/510"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"exercise"},{"@language":"en","@value":"facilities"},{"@language":"en","@value":"sports"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"anläggningar"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"exercise facilities"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"idrott"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"idrottsanläggning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"motion"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"sportanläggning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"sports facilities"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/EDUC"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sports and exercise facilities within Gävle Municipality.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrott- och motionsanläggningar i Gävle kommun.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2023-04-20"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sports and exercise"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrott och motion"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/507","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"idrott_motion.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/508","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/507"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"4059"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/507"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing  sports and exercise facilities in Gävle Municipality. Attribute data: namn=name, gatuadress=address, ort=city, beskr_kort=description short, URL=URL, upddatum=date of update.\nThe coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller sport- och idrottsanläggningar inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata består av namn, gatuadress, ort, beskr_kort, URL, upddatum.\nKoordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-10"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sports and exercise (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrott och motion (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/509","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"idrott_motion-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/510","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/509"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"2701"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/509"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing sports and exercise facilities in Gävle Municipality. Attribute data: namn=name, gatuadress=address, ort=city, beskr_kort=description short, URL=URL, upddatum=date of update.\nThe coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller sport- och idrottsanläggningar  inom Gävle kommun. Attributdata består av namn, gatuadress, ort, beskr_kort, URL, upddatum.\nKoordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-09-10"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Sports and exercise (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Idrott och motion (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:c5c11a8a49edc47566f372563cca8b4ce6652ccd7f8d752ff5c8549a1102678f_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:c5c11a8a49edc47566f372563cca8b4ce6652ccd7f8d752ff5c8549a1102678f"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:ccc7396f4bb444de240efc68d2c3d8a51d987c5e23412bb740cc21ef17a366ad_b0n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/145","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/146"},"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Addresses"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Buildings"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Details"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Properties"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Roads"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Water"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Adresser"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Byggnad"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fastigheter"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vatten"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Vägar"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/CONT"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The basemap provided by Gävle Municipality is constructed in an accurate, timeless way, it is tailored from set specifics. Gävle Municipality strive to have correct information, but we cannot guarantee it in all regard. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun upplyser om att baskartans innehåll med avseende på noggrannhet och aktualitet överensstämmer med fastställda specifikationer och beskrivningar. Gävle kommun strävar efter att informationen skall vara så riktig som möjligt men kan inte garantera det i alla avseenden.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:source":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/20"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/45"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/50"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/56"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/62"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/63"}],"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gävle's basemap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävles baskarta"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/146","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://gis.gavle.se/pubs/baskarta/wms?request=GetCapabilities&service=WMS"},"dct:conformsTo":{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/serviceType/ogc/wms"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Gävle's basemap as a Web Map Service (WMS). The basemap is best viewed on the scale 1:1000. The service supports three coordinate systems, SWEREF 99 16 30, SWEREF 99 TM and WGS 84. Read the service capabilites for more information.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle cannot guarantee that the service is available at all times. Recurrent system maintenance and other operations may result in service downtime."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävles baskarta som WMS. Baskartan är anpassad att visas i skala 1:1000. Tjänsten stödjer tre koordinatsystem, SWEREF 99 16 30, SWEREF 99 TM och WGS 84. Använd anropet GetCapabilites för att se mer information om tjänsten.\n\nGävle kommun kan inte garantera att tjänsten är tillgänglig vid alla tidpunkter. Återkommande systemunderhåll och andra driftåtgärder kan innebära att tjänsten ibland inte går att nå."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/WMS_SRVC"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap (WMS)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta (WMS)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kartdeklaration Gävle kommuns baskarta"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:ccc7396f4bb444de240efc68d2c3d8a51d987c5e23412bb740cc21ef17a366ad_b0n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:ccc7396f4bb444de240efc68d2c3d8a51d987c5e23412bb740cc21ef17a366ad"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:d16b91a9081b621cc5b720e0a7c376f3b614f5553bdfa67a6fc90723dd8ee9c6_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"When a local plan wins approval in the municipality of Gävle it is registered by the municipal cadastral authority in the national registry. A slight delay can occur before the registration takes place. The municipality of Gävle stores all plans in a local geodatabase. Newly registered plans are automatically transfered to the database from the national registry once a week."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"När en detaljplan vinner laga kraft i Gävle kommun registreras den av kommunala Lantmäterimyndigheten i fastighetsregistret hos Lantmäteriet. Det kan förekomma en viss fördröjning innan registreringen sker. Gävle kommun lagrar alla detaljplaner i en lokal databas. Nyregistrerade detaljplaner hämtas automatiskt hem från fastighetsregistret en gång i veckan."}]},{"@id":"_:d16b91a9081b621cc5b720e0a7c376f3b614f5553bdfa67a6fc90723dd8ee9c6_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/103","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/109"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/111"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Boundaries"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Plans"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Regulations"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Bestämmelser"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Planer"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Plangränser"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/REGI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/WEEKLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans in Gävle. For more information about planning, visit the Swedish National Board of Housing, Building and Planning, https://www.boverket.se.\n\nPlease visit Gävles plan archive, follow the link below.\n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner i Gävle. För mer information om detaljplanering, besök Boverkets hemsida på https://www.boverket.se.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till konsumenten. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för konsumenten till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:d16b91a9081b621cc5b720e0a7c376f3b614f5553bdfa67a6fc90723dd8ee9c6_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner"}]},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/108","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"planer.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/109","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/108"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"664304"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/108"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A shapefile containing local plans in Gävle. Attribute data contains plan name, plan type, document id, purpose, url to Gävles plan archive. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller detaljplaner i Gävle. Attributdata innehåller plantyp, namn, lantmäteri-akt, ändamål, länk till Gävles Planarkiv, datum då planen antogs (upddat) och fildatum. Koordinatsystemet är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-12"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/110","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"planer-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/111","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/110"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"282975"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/110"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A GeoJSON file containing local plans in Gävle. Attribute data contains plan name, plan type, document id, purpose, url to Gävles plan archive. The coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"en","@value":"En GeoJSON fil som innehåller planer i Gävle. Attributdata innehåller namn på planer. Koordinatsystemet är WGS84."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-12"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Local plans (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Detaljplaner (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:d16b91a9081b621cc5b720e0a7c376f3b614f5553bdfa67a6fc90723dd8ee9c6_b1n0"}}],"@id":"urn:source:d16b91a9081b621cc5b720e0a7c376f3b614f5553bdfa67a6fc90723dd8ee9c6"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:d474eb7053b5d01dda99dce0ef8da263fef009e473e2796201b30d8f66ab535a_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjdredovisningen för baskartan utgörs av 1-meters kurvor framställda från Lantmäteriets Nationella höjdmodell (NH) i höjdsystemet RH2000. Noggrannheten i höjdredovisningen är ca 0,3 m."}},{"@id":"_:d474eb7053b5d01dda99dce0ef8da263fef009e473e2796201b30d8f66ab535a_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/LocalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:marie.1.nilsson@gavle.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Gävle kommun"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.gavle.se"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269","@type":"foaf:Document","dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kartdeklaration Gävle kommuns baskarta"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/504","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-hojder-gpkg.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/505","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/504"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"234593755"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/504"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A geopackage containing elevation countours from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of elevation, date of last update and file date. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En geopackage som innehåller höjdkurvor från Gävles baskarta. Attributen består av höjd, uppdateringsdatum och fildatum. Filens koordinatsystem är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/GPKG"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-08"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elevations (*.gpkg)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjder (*.gpkg)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/59","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/505"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/73"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/91"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elevation contour"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjdkurva"}],"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/BIMONTHLY"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elevation contours from Gävles basemap. \n\nThe basemap provided by us is constructed in an accurate, timeless way, it is tailored from set specifics. We strive to have correct information, but we cannot guarantee it in all regard. \n\nThe Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for any errors or changes in open data that has been supplied by Gävle Municipality to the consumer. The Municipality of Gävle disclaims all responsibility for damage or other inconvenience resulting from improper use of open data in assimilated products or with other information."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjdkurvor från Gävles baskarta. \n\nGävle kommun upplyser om att baskartans innehåll med avseende på noggrannhet och aktualitet överensstämmer med fastställda specifikationer och beskrivningar. Gävle kommun strävar efter att informationen skall vara så riktig som möjligt men kan inte garantera det i alla avseenden.\n\nGävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för fel eller förändringar i öppna data som levererats från Gävle kommun till kunden. Gävle kommun friskriver sig från varje form av ansvar för skada eller annan olägenhet som kan uppkomma för kunden till följd av nyttjande av öppna data i följdproduktion eller tillsammans med annan information."}],"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:d474eb7053b5d01dda99dce0ef8da263fef009e473e2796201b30d8f66ab535a_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Basemap - Elevations"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Baskarta - Höjder"}],"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/269"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/64","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Öppna data Gävle","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:oppnadata@gavle.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:d474eb7053b5d01dda99dce0ef8da263fef009e473e2796201b30d8f66ab535a_b1n0"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/72","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-hojder.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/73","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/72"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"238919649"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/72"},"dct:description":[{"@language":"sv","@value":"A shapefile containing elevation countours from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of elevation, date of last update and file date. The coordinate system is SWEREF 99 16 30."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En shapefil som innehåller höjdkurvor från Gävles baskarta. Attributen består av höjd, uppdateringsdatum och fildatum. Filens koordinatsystem är SWEREF 99 16 30."}],"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/SHP"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-08"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elevations (*.shp)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjder (*.shp)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/90","@type":"http://entryscape.com/terms/File","dct:title":"baskarta-hojder-json.zip"},{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/91","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/90"},"dcat:byteSize":{"@type":"xsd:nonNegativeInteger","@value":"8317619"},"dcat:downloadURL":{"@id":"https://catalog.gavle.se/store/1/resource/90"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/json+zip","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"A geojson file containing elevation countours from Gävles basemap. Attribute data consist of elevation, date of last update and file date. The coordinate system is WGS84."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"En geojson-fil som innehåller höjdkurvor från Gävles baskarta. Attributen består av höjd, uppdateringsdatum och fildatum. Filens koordinatsystem är WGS840."}],"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-10-08"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Elevations (*.json)"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Höjder (*.json)"}],"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/distribution-status/COMPLETED"}}],"@id":"urn:source:d474eb7053b5d01dda99dce0ef8da263fef009e473e2796201b30d8f66ab535a"},{"@graph":[{"@id":"_:d851c78eafbf65d9c4141286d1ee4e350fb803cc9fb6899561647133567c654c_b0n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Innehållet i baskartans datamängder kommer ursprungligen från olika källor. Exempelvis Lantmäteriets fastighetskarta, fotogrammetisk digitalisering, traditionell inmätning med GNSS eller totalstation. Noggrannhet och aktualitet kan variera kraftigt beroende på insamlingsmetod och insamlingstillfälle. Det bör tas i beaktande vid användning av data."}},{"@id":"_:d851c78eafbf65d9c4141286d1ee4e350fb803cc9fb6899561647133567c654c_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+4626178000"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2120002338","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2120002338","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publi